<h1>Che &quot;Rhymefest&quot; Smith</h1>
<p>Chicago Board of Education, District 10a, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://rhymefestforcps.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (rhymefestforcps.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Smith&#39;s campaign platform centers on budgets, curriculum, and personnel: adequate funding for safe learning environments, comprehensive curricula including arts, physical education, and life skills, and support and professional development for educators. Seeking a second term, he has said he wants to expand student agency in board governance, including having students make up a third of public commenters and creating a student board member with a limited role, along with stronger support and training for Local School Councils.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Grammy and Academy Award-winning rapper and songwriter; elected to the board for District 10 in November 2024.</p>
